Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,293)}怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,338)}我忘了說是學習合宿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,383)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,428)}這還挺重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,473)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,518)}不過我已經解釋清楚了\N沒問題了！你那邊怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,598)}我沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,643)}好久沒去龍二家了\N以前經常去的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,723)}好期待去師傅家
